units          metal
atom_style     atomic
newton         on
boundary       p p f

read_data      /projects/westgroup/akinyemi.az/mace_lammps/MHI_Nickel/calculation/adsorption/phase1_h2/structures/slab_h2_s_5.lammps
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (12.631872 15.158246 52.690537)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
